        "official_en_sha256": "c116fe05809a780816a7915fc14ce4334526317191bdeb5f576ceb2c516c9890"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あとは反乱軍のアジトと、話に出ていた\r\nグランシェルトの砂漠の村に行ってみるのもありか。",
        "official_en": "We could also talk to some of my fellow rebels at the hideout, and take a trip to that desert village she mentioned.",
        "real_en": null
      },
